<article class="env-lemma" id="06W0">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06W0">Lemma <span data-tag="06W0">96.9.1</span>.</a> Let $p : \mathcal{X} \to (\mathit{Sch}/S)_{fppf}$ be a category fibred in groupoids. Let $\tau \in \{ Zar, {\acute{e}tale}, smooth, syntomic, fppf\} $. Let $x \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{X})$ lying over $U = p(x)$. The functor $p$ induces an equivalence of sites $\mathcal{X}_\tau /x \to (\mathit{Sch}/U)_\tau $. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Special case of Stacks, Lemma <a href="/tag/0CN0" data-tag="0CN0">8.10.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>